<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY QINGXIN</view><view class="title">我的清欣</view><view class="sub">每一份身份，都有清楚的记录。</view><view class="card"><view class="identity-row"><view class="avatar">清</view><view><view class="name">{{user ? user.nickname : '欢迎，新朋友'}}</view><view class="tag">{{user ? user.identityName : '尚未登录'}}</view></view></view><view class="sub">{{!user ? '登录后查看当前身份，保存你的联系方式。' : user.identity === 'D' ? '你当前尚未入驻成为代理，登录不会自动开通代理身份。' : '你的代理身份已生效，购买时将使用对应身份价格。'}}</view><button wx:if="!user" class="primary" bindtap="onLogin" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">登录清欣</button></view><view wx:if="user"><view class="section-title">个人资料</view><view class="label">昵称</view><input value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="onNickname" maxlength="30" placeholder="填写昵称"/><view class="label">联系电话</view><input value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="可选，填写 11 位手机号"/><view class="help">联系电话用于品牌方与你沟通，不代表已完成手机号认证。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存资料</button><button class="logout" bindtap="onLogout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button></view><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="devAuth" class="dev"><view>本地调试账号</view><picker range="{{accounts}}" value="{{accountIndex}}" bindchange="onAccount"><button class="secondary">{{accounts[accountIndex]}} · 点击切换</button></picker></view></view>
